    "body": "Yes, in WebKit, we also only do this for HTML documents:\r\nhttps://trac.webkit.org/browser/webkit/trunk/Source/WebCore/bindings/js/JSDOMWindowProperties.cpp#L65\r\n\r\nThose properties are currently stored in a map in the HTMLDocument class, so we'd need to do a bit of refactoring to do this for all types of documents.",
